Minicloud license scope

The Minicloud control plane is licensed under AGPL-3.0-only. This includes
the API, dashboard, worker, runtime agent, telemetry, server-side Common
project, runtime templates, and server tests and deployment scripts.

The CLI, shared client contracts, CLI tests, and CLI distribution tooling are
licensed under MPL-2.0. See docs/licensing.md for the path map.

Full license texts:
  LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-only.txt
  LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt

Third-party material remains under its respective license.
